{"unit_id":"tag:0CMZ:prose-0001","translation":"\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n我们对函子（functors）<MATH_0001> 和 <MATH_0002>（来自第 <REF_0001> 节）及 <MATH_0003> 和 <MATH_0004>（来自第 <REF_0002> 节）采用的记号取自 <REF_0003>。作出这些选择后，第 <REF_0004> 节中函子（functor）<MATH_0005> 的记号及第 <REF_0005> 节中 <MATH_0006> 的记号似乎是合理的。本节将我们的记号与 SGA4 的记号进行比较。\n\n<STRUCT_0002><STRUCT_0003>\n<TEXTBFOPEN_0001>预层（Presheaves）：<TEXTBFCLOSE_0001>设 <MATH_0007> 是范畴（categories）之间的函子（functor）。函子（functor）<MATH_0008> 在 <MATH_0009> 这一记号下出现于 <REF_0006>。函子（functor）<MATH_0010> 在 <MATH_0011> 这一记号下出现于 <REF_0007>。函子（functor）<MATH_0012> 在 <MATH_0013> 这一记号下出现于 <REF_0008>。换言之，有\n<MATHSEG_0001>与<MATHSEG_0002>\n读者须留意，SGA4 的不同部分对这些函子（functors）使用不同的记号。\n\n<STRUCT_0004><STRUCT_0005>\n<TEXTBFOPEN_0002>层（Sheaves）与连续（continuous）函子（functors）：<TEXTBFCLOSE_0002>\n假设 <MATH_0014> 与 <MATH_0015> 是位点（sites），且 <MATH_0016> 是连续（continuous）函子（functor）（定义 <REF_0009>）。函子（functor）<MATH_0017> 在 <MATH_0018> 这一记号下出现于 <REF_0010>。函子（functor）<MATH_0019> 在 <MATH_0020> 这一记号下出现于 <REF_0011>。换言之，有\n<MATHSEG_0003>与<MATHSEG_0004>\n当 <MATH_0021> 定义位点（sites）的态射（morphism）<MATH_0022> 时（定义 <REF_0012>），可见关联的拓扑斯态射（morphism of topoi）（引理 <REF_0013>）与 <REF_0014> 中的相同。\n\n<STRUCT_0006><STRUCT_0007>\n<TEXTBFOPEN_0003>层（Sheaves）与余连续（cocontinuous）函子（functors）：<TEXTBFCLOSE_0003>\n假设 <MATH_0023> 与 <MATH_0024> 是位点（sites），且 <MATH_0025> 是余连续（cocontinuous）函子（functor）（定义 <REF_0015>）。函子（functor）<MATH_0026>（引理 <REF_0016>）在 <MATH_0027> 这一记号下出现于 <REF_0017>。函子（functor）<MATH_0028> 在 <MATH_0029> 这一记号下出现于 <REF_0018>。换言之，有\n<MATHSEG_0005>与<MATHSEG_0006>\n因此，与 <MATH_0030> 关联的拓扑斯态射（morphism of topoi）（见引理 <REF_0019>）与 <REF_0020> 中的相同。\n\n<STRUCT_0008><STRUCT_0009>\n<TEXTBFOPEN_0004>拓扑斯态射（Morphisms of Topoi）：<TEXTBFCLOSE_0004>若 <MATH_0031> 是由函子（functors）<MATH_0032> 给出的拓扑斯态射（morphism of topoi），则函子（functor）<MATH_0033> 在 <MATH_0034> 这一记号下出现于 <REF_0021>。我们将用 <MATH_0035> 表示集合（sets）的层（sheaves），或者更一般的代数结构（algebraic structure）的层（sheaves）的逆像（pullback）（第 <REF_0022> 节）。我们将用 <MATH_0036> 表示环化拓扑斯的态射（morphism of ringed topoi）的模（modules）的层（sheaves）的逆像（pullback）（《位点上的模（Modules on Sites）》定义 <REF_0023>）。\n\n\n\n","allowed_english":["SGA"],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"functors","target_term":"函子"},{"source_term":"functor","target_term":"函子"},{"source_term":"Presheaves","target_term":"预层"},{"source_term":"categories","target_term":"范畴"},{"source_term":"functor","target_term":"函子"},{"source_term":"functor","target_term":"函子"},{"source_term":"functor","target_term":"函子"},{"source_term":"functor","target_term":"函子"},{"source_term":"functors","target_term":"函子"},{"source_term":"Sheaves","target_term":"层"},{"source_term":"continuous","target_term":"连续"},{"source_term":"functors","target_term":"函子"},{"source_term":"sites","target_term":"位点"},{"source_term":"continuous","target_term":"连续"},{"source_term":"functor","target_term":"函子"},{"source_term":"functor","target_term":"函子"},{"source_term":"functor","target_term":"函子"},{"source_term":"sites","target_term":"位点"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"morphism of topoi","target_term":"拓扑斯态射"},{"source_term":"Sheaves","target_term":"层"},{"source_term":"cocontinuous","target_term":"余连续"},{"source_term":"functors","target_term":"函子"},{"source_term":"sites","target_term":"位点"},{"source_term":"cocontinuous","target_term":"余连续"},{"source_term":"functor","target_term":"函子"},{"source_term":"functor","target_term":"函子"},{"source_term":"functor","target_term":"函子"},{"source_term":"morphism of topoi","target_term":"拓扑斯态射"},{"source_term":"Morphisms of Topoi","target_term":"拓扑斯态射"},{"source_term":"functors","target_term":"函子"},{"source_term":"morphism of topoi","target_term":"拓扑斯态射"},{"source_term":"functor","target_term":"函子"},{"source_term":"sets","target_term":"集合"},{"source_term":"sheaves","target_term":"层"},{"source_term":"algebraic structure","target_term":"代数结构"},{"source_term":"sheaves","target_term":"层"},{"source_term":"pullback","target_term":"逆像"},{"source_term":"morphism of ringed topoi","target_term":"环化拓扑斯的态射"},{"source_te