{"unit_id":"tag:00YW:prose-0001","translation":"\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n本节定义范畴（category）上的拓扑（topology），如 <REF_0001> 中所定义的那样。可以用这种语言发展层（sheaves）和拓扑斯（topoi）的全部理论工具。<REF_0002> 中可找到这些内容的现代阐述。然而，对代数几何（algebraic geometry）最有意义的情形是位点（site）在其底层范畴（underlying category）上定义的拓扑（topology）。因此，我们强烈建议初次阅读的读者 <TEXTBFOPEN_0001>跳过本节以及本章其余所有节<TEXTBFCLOSE_0001>！\n\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴"},{"source_term":"topology","target_term":"拓扑"},{"source_term":"sheaves","target_term":"层"},{"source_term":"topoi","target_term":"拓扑斯"},{"source_term":"algebraic geometry","target_term":"代数几何"},{"source_term":"site","target_term":"位点"},{"source_term":"underlying category","target_term":"底层范畴"},{"source_term":"topology","target_term":"拓扑"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴","context":"待决。"},{"source_term":"topology","target_term":"拓扑","context":"待决。"},{"source_term":"sheaves","target_term":"层","context":"待决。"},{"source_term":"topoi","target_term":"拓扑斯","context":"待决。"},{"source_term":"algebraic geometry","target_term":"代数几何","context":"待决。"},{"source_term":"site","target_term":"位点","context":"待决。"},{"source_term":"underlying category","target_term":"底层范畴","context":"待决。"}],"notes":[]}
