{"unit_id":"tag:00YW:prose-0002","translation":"\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n换言之，一个定义于 <MATH_0001> 上的筛（sieve）为每个对象（object）<MATH_0002> 选出子集（subset）<MATH_0003>，它属于所有态射（morphisms）<MATH_0004> 的集合（set）。事实上，子集（subsets）族\n<MATH_0005>\n唯一须满足的条件是以下规则\n<MATH_0006>\n一个有用的直观图景是，将映射（map）<MATH_0007> 看作“从 <MATH_0008> 到 <MATH_0009> 的态射（morphism）”。\n\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"sieve","target_term":"筛"},{"source_term":"object","target_term":"对象"},{"source_term":"subset","target_term":"子集"},{"source_term":"morphisms","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"set","target_term":"集合"},{"source_term":"subsets","target_term":"子集"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"sieve","target_term":"筛","context":"待决。"},{"source_term":"object","target_term":"对象","context":"待决。"},{"source_term":"subset","target_term":"子集","context":"待决。"},{"source_term":"morphisms","target_term":"态射","context":"待决。"},{"source_term":"set","target_term":"集合","context":"待决。"},{"source_term":"subsets","target_term":"子集","context":"待决。"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射","context":"待决。"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射","context":"待决。"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:00YZ:statement","translation":"设 <MATH_0001> 是范畴（category）。设 <MATH_0002>。\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002> 定义于 <MATH_0003> 上的筛（sieves）的全体是一个集合（set）。\n<STRUCT_0003> 包含（Inclusion）在这个集合（set）上定义了偏序（partial ordering）。\n<STRUCT_0004> 筛（sieves）的并（Unions）和交（intersections）都是筛（sieves）。\n<STRUCT_0005>\n<LOCKED_0001>\n给定态射族（family of morphisms）<MATH_0004>，属于 <MATH_0005> 且以 <MATH_0006> 为目标，存在唯一的最小筛（sieve）<MATH_0007>（定义于 <MATH_0008> 上），使得每个 <MATH_0009> 都属于 <MATH_0010>。\n<STRUCT_0006> 筛（sieve）<MATH_0011> 是最大的筛（sieve）。\n<STRUCT_0007> 空（empty）子预层（subpresheaf）是最小的筛（sieve）。\n<STRUCT_0008>\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴"},{"source_term":"sieves","target_term":"筛"},{"source_term":"set","target_term":"集合"},{"source_term":"Inclusion","target_term":"包含"},{"source_term":"set","target_term":"集合"},{"source_term":"partial ordering","target_term":"偏序"},{"source_term":"sieves","target_term":"筛"},{"source_term":"Unions","target_term":"并"},{"source_term":"intersections","target_term":"交"},{"source_term":"sieves","target_term":"筛"},{"source_term":"family of morphisms","target_term":"态射族"},{"source_term":"sieve","target_term":"筛"},{"source_term":"sieve","target_term":"筛"},{"source_term":"sieve","target_term":"筛"},{"source_term":"empty","target_term":"空"},{"source_term":"subpresheaf","target_term":"子预层"},{"source_term":"sieve","target_term":"筛"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴","context":"待决。"},{"source_term":"sieves","target_term":"筛","context":"待决。"},{"source_term":"set","target_term":"集合","context":"待决。"},{"source_term":"Inclusion","target_term":"包含","context":"待决。"},{"source_term":"partial ordering","target_term":"偏序","context":"待决。"},{"source_term":"Unions","target_term":"并","context":"待决。"},{"source_term":"intersections","target_term":"交","context":"待决。"},{"source_term":"family of morphisms","target_term":"态射族","context":"待决。"},{"source_term":"sieve","target_term":"筛","context":"待决。"},{"source_te