{"unit_id":"tag:00YZ:proof","translation":"由子预层（subpresheaf）的定义，一个预层（presheaf）<MATH_0001> 的所有子预层（subpresheaves）的全体是 <MATH_0002> 的子集（subset）。而这是一个集合（set）。（这里 <MATH_0003> 表示 <MATH_0004> 的幂集（powerset）。）因此，定义于 <MATH_0005> 上的筛（sieves）的全体是集合（set）。\n\n<STRUCT_0001><STRUCT_0002>\n偏序（partial ordering）定义如下：<MATH_0006> 当且仅当 <MATH_0007> 对所有 <MATH_0008> 成立。记号为 <MATH_0009>。\n\n<STRUCT_0003><STRUCT_0004>\n给定一族筛（sieves）<MATH_0010>、<MATH_0011>（定义于 <MATH_0012> 上），可以将 <MATH_0013> 定义为取值满足 <MATH_0014>（对所有 <MATH_0015> 成立）的筛（sieve）。以相同方式定义交（intersection）<MATH_0016>。\n\n<STRUCT_0005><STRUCT_0006>\n给定如陈述中的 <MATH_0017>，考虑预层（presheaves）的态射（morphisms）<MATH_0018>。我们简单地将 <MATH_0019> 定义为这些预层（presheaves）的映射（maps）的像（images）（定义 <REF_0001>）的并（union）。\n\n<STRUCT_0007><STRUCT_0008>\n引理的最后两个陈述是显然的。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"subpresheaf","target_term":"子预层"},{"source_term":"presheaf","target_term":"预层"},{"source_term":"subpresheaves","target_term":"子预层"},{"source_term":"subset","target_term":"子集"},{"source_term":"set","target_term":"集合"},{"source_term":"powerset","target_term":"幂集"},{"source_term":"sieves","target_term":"筛"},{"source_term":"set","target_term":"集合"},{"source_term":"partial ordering","target_term":"偏序"},{"source_term":"sieves","target_term":"筛"},{"source_term":"sieve","target_term":"筛"},{"source_term":"intersection","target_term":"交"},{"source_term":"presheaves","target_term":"预层"},{"source_term":"morphisms","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"presheaves","target_term":"预层"},{"source_term":"maps","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"images","target_term":"像"},{"source_term":"union","target_term":"并"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"subpresheaf","target_term":"子预层","context":"待决。"},{"source_term":"presheaf","target_term":"预层","context":"待决。"},{"source_term":"subpresheaves","target_term":"子预层","context":"待决。"},{"source_term":"subset","target_term":"子集","context":"待决。"},{"source_term":"set","target_term":"集合","context":"待决。"},{"source_term":"powerset","targe